  "statuteText": "259:19-a Direct Import Vehicle. –\n\n\"Direct import vehicle\" shall mean a vehicle not originally manufactured in accordance with the requirements of the United States Motor Vehicle Safety Act and the United States Clean Air Act and the regulations thereunder. A title for any such vehicle when issued by the director or his agent shall contain a legend identifying the vehicle as a \"direct import vehicle.\""
